  "created": "2026-11-20T10:45:29.083Z",
  "description": "ExpertPdf Anywhere is the cross-platform ExpertPdf library for .NET (Windows x64 and x86, Linux x64 and ARM64, and macOS on Apple Silicon), with the ExpertPdf API: the HTML to PDF and HTML to image converter (PdfConverter, ImgConverter) on a Chromium engine with HTML5, CSS3, web fonts and JavaScript; the PDF creator (Document, pages, text, images, shapes, links, HTML and RTF elements, templates, headers and footers); Word, Excel, PowerPoint and RTF to PDF; merge (PDFMerge) and split (PDFSplitManager); security (PdfSecurityManager: passwords, permissions, encryption up to AES-256, digital signatures); PDF to text, PDF to image and image extraction; PDF to Word, Excel and PowerPoint; PDF/A-1a to PDF/A-4f, PDF/X-1a, tagged PDF/UA, and ZUGFeRD / Factur-X electronic invoices. Runs on .NET 11, .NET 10, .NET 9 and .NET 8, and on .NET Framework 4.6.1+ through .NET Standard 2.0. Install a matching ExpertPdf.Anywhere.Native runtime package (win-x64, win-x86, linux-x64, linux-arm64 or osx-arm64) for the engines, or a platform package (ExpertPdf.Anywhere.Windows, .Linux, .Linux.Arm64, .MacOS) that brings both.",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.png",
