  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.ExpertPdf.Anywhere.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 22.0.0 is the first release of ExpertPdf Anywhere, the cross-platform ExpertPdf library for .NET: the API of the ExpertPdf HTML to PDF Converter, PDF Creator, PDF Merge, PDF Split, PDF Security, PDF to Text, PDF to Image, PDF Images Extractor and RTF to PDF in one library, under the ExpertPdf.Anywhere namespaces. Windows x64 and x86, Linux x64 and ARM64, macOS on Apple Silicon; .NET 11, .NET 10, .NET 9, .NET 8 and .NET Standard 2.0 (.NET Framework 4.6.1+). A Chromium engine for HTML to PDF and HTML to image, inside the application by default, with asynchronous conversions and cancellation, or in the ExpertPdf remote engine container. Word, Excel, PowerPoint and RTF to PDF; PDF to Word, Excel and PowerPoint. Automatic table of contents, HTML forms as PDF form fields. PDF/UA-1 and PDF/UA-2, PDF/A-1a to PDF/A-4f, PDF/X-1a, ZUGFeRD / Factur-X invoices. Form filling, redaction, page resizing, portfolios, page objects and layers; damaged files are opened. AES-256 encryption, signature validation, long-term validation, SHA-384 and SHA-512 signatures, external signers, certificate store and PKCS#11 signing. Full release notes: https://docs.html-to-pdf.net/anywhere-library/html/ReleaseNotes.htm",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "ExpertPdf Anywhere is the cross-platform ExpertPdf library for .NET: HTML to PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint and RTF to PDF, PDF creation, merge, split, security, PDF to text, PDF to image and PDF to Word, Excel and PowerPoint.",
  "title": "ExpertPdf Anywhere - Cross-Platform HTML to PDF Converter and PDF Library for .NET (Windows, Linux, macOS)",
